915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[48,35,74,70,78,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[48,35,74,70,78,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[48,35,74,70,78,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1025","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[48,35,74,70,78,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1018","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[48,35,74,70,78,71],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"7800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10064","city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[48,35,74,70,78,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027505"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"诸葛珪之弟，诸葛亮叔父。初为刘表属吏，奉刘表之命出使汉廷传达荆州概况，出发前获知兄长诸葛珪病逝，向刘表请求完成使命后赴泰山照料后事。任务结束后赴徐州照顾诸葛珪的遗孀及子女。时曹操出兵徐州征伐陶谦，为躲避战祸，他携带诸葛亮、诸葛均及两位侄女前往江东。后被袁术任命为豫章太守，但汉廷又任命朱皓代替他，朱皓向扬州刺史刘繇求兵攻打诸葛玄。建安二年，诸葛玄被西城居民叛乱所杀。有学者考证诸葛玄为诸葛诞之父。","tc":"諸葛珪之弟，諸葛亮叔父。初為劉表屬吏，奉劉表之命出使漢廷傳達荊州概況，出發前獲知兄長諸葛珪病逝，向劉表請求完成使命后赴泰山照料后事。任務結束后赴徐州照顧諸葛珪的遺孀及子女。時曹操出兵徐州征伐陶謙，為躲避戰禍，他攜帶諸葛亮、諸葛均及兩位侄女前往江東。后被袁術任命為豫章太守，但漢廷又任命朱皓代替他，朱皓向揚州刺史劉繇求兵攻打諸葛玄。建安二年，諸葛玄被西城居民叛亂所殺。有學者考證諸葛玄為諸葛誕之父。","en":"The younger brother of Zhuge Gui and the uncle of Zhuge Liang. Initially a subordinate of Liu Biao, he was dispatched by Liu Biao on a mission to the Han imperial court to report on conditions in Jing Province. Learning of his elder brother Zhuge Gui's passing before departing, he requested Liu Biao's permission to attend to the funeral affairs in Mount Tai after completing his mission. Once his duties concluded, he traveled to Xu Province to care for Zhuge Gui's widow and children. At that time, Cao Cao launched an expedition into Xu Province against Tao Qian. To escape the ravages of war, he took Zhuge Liang, Zhuge Jun, and his two nieces to Jiangdong. Later, Yuan Shu appointed him Governor of Yuzhang, but the Han court appointed Zhu Hao to replace him. Zhu Hao requested troops from Liu Yao, Lt. Governor of Yang Province, to attack Zhuge Xuan. In the second year of Jian'an, Zhuge Xuan was killed during a rebellion by the residents of Xicheng. Some scholars have posited that Zhuge Xuan was the father of Zhuge Dan.","jp":"諸葛珪の弟で、諸葛亮の叔父。初めは劉表の属吏となり、劉表の命を受けて漢廷に使者として赴き荊州の概況を伝えた。出発前に兄の諸葛珪の病没を知り、使命を終えた後に泰山へ赴いて後事を執り行うことを劉表に願い出た。任務終了後、徐州へ赴いて諸葛珪の未亡人や子女の世話をした。当時、曹操が徐州に出兵して陶謙を討伐したため、戦禍を避けるべく諸葛亮、諸葛均および二人の姪を連れて江東へ向かった。後に袁術によって豫章太守に任じられたが、漢廷が朱皓を任じてこれに代えたため、朱皓は揚州刺史の劉繇に兵を求めて諸葛玄を攻めた。建安二年、諸葛玄は西城の住民の反乱によって殺害された。諸葛玄を諸葛誕の父と考証する学者もいる。","kr":"제갈규의 아우이자 제갈량의 숙부이다. 처음에는 유표의 속리로, 유표의 명을 받들어 한나라 조정에 사신으로 가 형주의 정세를 보고하게 되었다. 출발하기에 앞서 형 제갈규가 병으로 세상을 떠났다는 소식을 듣고, 유표에게 사명을 마친 뒤 태산으로 가 뒷수습을 할 수 있도록 청하였다. 임무를 마친 뒤 서주로 가 제갈규의 유가족과 자녀들을 보살폈다. 이때 조조가 서주를 침공해 도겸을 정벌하자, 전화를 피하고자 제갈량과 제갈균 및 두 조카딸을 데리고 강동으로 건너갔다. 이후 원술에 의해 예장태수에 임명되었으나, 한나라 조정에서 주호를 대신 임명하자 주호는 양주자사 유요에게 군사를 청하여 제갈현을 공격하였다. 건안 2년, 제갈현은 서성 주민들의 반란으로 목숨을 잃었다. 일부 학자들의 고증에 따르면 제갈현이 제갈탄의 아버지라고도 한다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1028415","remark":"","surname":"诸葛","surnameTc":"諸葛","surnameEn":"Zhuge","surnameJp":"諸葛","surnameKr":"제갈","surnameOther":"","name":"玄","nameTc":"玄","nameEn":"Xuan","nameJp":"玄","nameKr":"현","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"诸葛玄","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"0","city":"CS1018","gender":"0","rule":"48","force":"35","wise":"74","politics":"70","charm":"78","will":"71","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"21/22/23/12/32/80/21/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1001502","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1003705","warSoulPoint":"4000","battleSoulPoint":"2500","debateSoulPoint":"5000","strategy":"","strategy2":"1000805","professions":"0/1/0/1/0/0/1/3/4/3/2/1/3/4/2/0/1/3/0/1/0/1/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"89","loyalty":"100","reputation":"7800","evaluate":"5000","title":"","rank":"5","birth":"159","show":"184","death":"197","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027505","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"15/0;12/0;31/0;26/0;21/0;29/0;20/0;8/0;2/0;19/0","father":"","mother":"","children